   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Hi users,</font><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">I made a similar question previously but I think it was my error to not express it well. </font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">The question is, when generating data, can I set the Estimate and Std Err of path coefficients (the ones in bold)?</font></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">Regressions:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">                   Estimate  Std.Err  z-value  P(&gt;|z|)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">  </span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">y1 ~                                               <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">    x          (a)    <b>0.537    0.010</b>   54.050    0.000<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">  y2 ~                                               <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">    x          (b)    <b>0.242    0.011</b>   21.165    0.000</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">   y1         (c)     <b>0.463    0.010</b>   45.746    0.000  <br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">I succeed to set the Estimate as I shown below, but how to manipulate the Std Error?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"color:red;font-family:Garamond,serif;font-size:12pt\">N &lt;- 10000</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">x &lt;- rnorm(N)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">y1 &lt;- 0.55*x +</span> <span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">rnorm(N)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">y2 &lt;- 0.24*x +</span><span lang=\"ES\"> </span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">0.47*y1 </span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">+</span><span lang=\"ES\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-family:Garamond,serif;font-size:16px\">rnorm(N)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-family:Garamond,serif;font-size:16px\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Hope I clarify my question</span></p></div></div></div>\r\n"
