   "subject": "Re: Set the Estimate and Std Err of path coefficients",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">\r\nHi,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>No, you cannot set the estimate or the standard error. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>What you can do and indeed do below is to set the population values. The estimates converge to those population values if the estimator is consistent and the sample size is large. So you are not really setting the estimates, but your scenario\r\n is such that the estimates will get close to the population values. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>There is no population counterpart for a standard errors, which simply estimates the precision of the estimates.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Mikko</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div>On 11 Apr 2019, at 10.32, MARIO GARRIDO ESCUDERO &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gaia...@usal.es</a>&gt; wrote:</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Hi users,</font>\r\n<div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">I made a similar question previously but I think it was my error to not express it well. </font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">The question is, when generating data, can I set the Estimate and Std Err of path coefficients (the ones in bold)?</font></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">Regressions:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">                   Estimate  Std.Err  z-value  P(&gt;|z|)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">  </span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">y1 ~                                               <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">    x          (a)   \r\n<b>0.537    0.010</b>   54.050    0.000<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">  y2 ~                                               <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">    x          (b)    <b>0.242    0.011</b>   21.165    0.000</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-family:Garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,112,192)\">   y1         (c)     <b>0.463    0.010</b>   45.746    0.000  <br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;color:rgb(80,0,80);line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">I succeed to set the Estimate as I shown below, but how to manipulate the Std Error?</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span style=\"color:red;font-family:Garamond,serif;font-size:12pt\">N &lt;- 10000</span><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">x &lt;- rnorm(N)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">y1 &lt;- 0.55*x +</span> <span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">rnorm(N)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n<span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">y2 &lt;- 0.24*x +</span><span lang=\"ES\"> </span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">0.47*y1 </span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Garamond,serif;color:red\">+</span><span lang=\"ES\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-family:Garamond,serif;font-size:16px\">rnorm(N)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-family:Garamo